# edge-ai-yocto systemd presets.
#
# Ordered before oe-core's 99-default.preset (`disable *`); first match wins.
#
# Vendor-layer units (v4l2-init, audio-init) from meta-rz-distro are suppressed
# at parse time via BBMASK in kas/base.yml, not here. Future tiers can add lines
# like:
#
#   disable rpcbind.service
#   disable rpcbind.socket

# systemd-resolved.service lives in the main systemd package, which oe-core
# leaves out of SYSTEMD_PACKAGES — so it has no recipe auto-enable and the
# `disable *` default would ship it off. networkd does addressing but not DNS;
# without resolved, /etc/resolv.conf has no nameserver. Enable it here.
enable systemd-resolved.service
